ing. The bonus of a dedicated parking spot simplifies daily routines. Expect to have easier everyday living as trash service and yard maintenance are included. When downtime calls, the community pool provides an easily accessible oasis for residents. You'll love having access to great schools and Advent Health hospital within a stone's throw. Enjoy the best of Davenport, with several restaurants and shopping at Posner Park located just around the corner. Please feel free to arrange a viewing of this beautiful townhouse. You'll be glad you did!","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":1800,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/203d98a431ede53e624f504ec6091debl-m1725463807r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["garage","house_view","yard","complete","front"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/203d98a431ede53e624f504ec6091debl-m1725463807s.jpg"],"resolution_source":"MAX convention / supplied original"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/203d98a431ede53e624f504ec6091debl-m896315956r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["aerial_view","yard"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/203d98a431ede53e624f504ec6091debl-m896315956s.jpg"],"resolution_source":"MAX convention / supplied original"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/203d98a431ede53e624f504ec6091debl-m3120004773r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["other_interiors"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/203d98a431ede53e624f504ec6091debl-m3120004773s.jpg"],"resolution_source":"MAX convention / supplied original"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/203d98a431ede53e624f504ec6091debl-m1730620282r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["kitchen"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/203d98a431ede53e624f504ec6091debl-m1730620282s.jpg"],"resolution_source":"MAX convention / supplied original"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/203d98a431ede53e624f